IN PLAIN ENGLISH, FOR THIS PROJECT

Take it. Build on it. Sell what you make. You do not need permission and you do
not need to credit anyone.

Attribution is appreciated but never required. If you want to point somewhere,
point at https://scovert.com/spindle.html

The one thing that is NOT covered by this dedication: the games themselves
(their code, art, text and audio) remain the property of whoever made them. This
dedication covers the SHARED UNIVERSE — the cosmology, the threads, the open
canon, Grishnak, and the rules for using them.

